          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U-Abrahama wakhuleka kuNkulunkulu; uNkulunkulu wamphulukisa u-Abimeleki, nomkakhe, nezincekukazi zakhe; futhi bazala abantwana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
